<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B><A NAME="a_003"></A>PROPOSAL NO. 2</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>THE MEMORANDUM AND ARTICLES AMENDMENT NO. 1
PROPOSAL</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>GENERAL</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our Board has determined, subject to the Share
Capital Increase Proposal being approved at the Meeting and following the Share Capital Increase being effected, it is advisable and in
the best interests of the Company and its shareholders, for the Company to adopt an amended and restated memorandum and articles of association
of the Company to reflect, among other things: (i) the Share Capital Increase; (ii) that any questions which arise in a meeting of the
directors must be decided by a majority of votes of the directors present and voting, provided always that, where Mr. Botao Ma (or his
duly appointed designee) is present at the meeting, such majority must include the affirmative vote of Mr. Ma (or, where applicable, his
duly appointed alternate) (the &ldquo;<B>Veto Right</B>&rdquo;), however, if Mr. Ma had received the notice of such meeting and is absent
or if Mr. Ma is not entitled to vote pursuant to Article 19 of the amended and restated memorandum and articles of association, then the
Board may determine any questions without the vote or consent of Mr. Ma, and (iii) to amend the provisions on permissible directors&rsquo;
interests so that a director may vote, and be counted in the quorum, on any matter in which he or she is interested, subject to disclosure
of that interest, in the form attached hereto as&nbsp;<U>Annex&nbsp;A</U>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Providing Mr. Botao Ma the Veto Right as described above over decisions
made by the Board where he is present and entitled to vote will allow him to override any Board decisions.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The amended and restated memorandum and articles
of association also reflect correction to typographical errors.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">You are encouraged to read the amended and restated
memorandum and articles of association attached hereto as <U>Annex A</U> carefully.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This Proposal is conditional upon the Share Capital
Increase Proposal above being passed at the Meeting. If this proposal is approved but the Share Capital Increase Proposal is not approved,
this proposal shall have no effect.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>RESOLUTION TO BE VOTED UPON</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The full text of the resolution to be proposed
is as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><I>&ldquo;It is resolved, as a special
resolution, that subject to and immediately following the Share Capital Increase being effected, the Company adopt an amended and restated
memorandum and articles of association, in the form attached to the notice of meeting and proxy statement delivered to shareholders and
dated September 9, 2026, in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the Company&rsquo;s existing memorandum and articles of association.:</I></P>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><I>&nbsp;</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>VOTE REQUIRED FOR APPROVAL</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The approval of the Memorandum and Articles Amendment
No. 1 Proposal requires a special resolution under Cayman Islands law, being the affirmative vote of at least two-thirds of the votes
cast by such shareholders as, being entitled to do so, vote in person or by proxy at the Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Abstentions and broker non-votes, while considered
present for the purposes of establishing a quorum, will not count as a vote cast at the Meeting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS RECOMMENDS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>A VOTE <I>FOR<BR>
</I>THE MEMORANDUM AND ARTICLES AMENDMENT NO. 1 PROPOSAL.</B></P>




<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"></P>

